{
  "_doc": "A send now that is on screen and online when its undo window ends goes from the device (shared/src/direct-send.ts, Android :core DirectSend.kt). `decision`: directSendDecision(input) (times in epoch ms; lateMs is DIRECT_SEND_LATE_MS, handoverMaxMs DIRECT_HANDOVER_MAX_MS, sendTimeoutMs DIRECT_SEND_TIMEOUT_MS: how long the device waits for drafts.send before leaving the send to the server) — \"send\" when the device sends it itself, otherwise why the server's task does. `route`: isGmailRoute(from, sendAs, resendDomain) is true (\"send\") only for the Gmail address or an alias Gmail verified, never for resendDomain. `sender`: draftSender(headers) is the one From header's single plain mailbox, lower-cased, or null for anything the device leaves to the server. `failure`: directSendFailure(error) after the device's own drafts.send failed: \"rejected\" for a refusal the server would fail at once, \"leave\" for anything the server's takeover settles.",
  "lateMs": 30000,
  "handoverMaxMs": 60000,
  "sendTimeoutMs": 30000,
  "clientFields": [
    "draftId",
    "from",
    "status",
    "sendAt",
    "chosenAt",
    "threadId"
  ],
  "decision": [
    {
      "name": "a send now at its time, from Gmail, goes from the device",
      "input": {
        "sendNow": true,
        "docs": 1,
        "online": true,
        "gmailRoute": true,
        "wroteSendAt": 1000000,
        "doc": {
          "status": "waiting",
          "sendAt": 1000000,
          "fields": [
            "draftId",
            "from",
            "status",
            "sendAt",
            "chosenAt",
            "threadId"
          ]
        },
        "now": 1000000
      },
      "expect": "send"
    },
    {
      "name": "a few seconds late still goes",
      "input": {
        "sendNow": true,
        "docs": 1,
        "online": true,
        "gmailRoute": true,
        "wroteSendAt": 1000000,
        "doc": {
          "status": "waiting",
          "sendAt": 1000000,
          "fields": [
            "draftId",
            "from",
            "status",
            "sendAt",
            "chosenAt",
            "threadId"
          ]
        },
        "now": 1030000
      },
      "expect": "send"
    },
    {
      "name": "past the late limit the server has it",
      "input": {
        "sendNow": true,
        "docs": 1,
        "online": true,
